re through the whirlwind, this thing won=E2=80=99t just be a rescue=E2=80=
=94it=E2=80=99ll be a full resurrection, annotated and composited with purp=
ose.</span></p><p><span class=3D"font-ligatures-none">Glad you checked in. =
