 class=3D"hljs-emphasis">_KB5058379\Windows\WinSxS\`

---

## Lessons Learned

- Explorer wildcard renames (`...`) can produce non-reversible identity los=
s =20
- Metadata logs and folder hash suffixes are essential for rollback =20
- WinSxS folder names are not cosmetic=E2=80=94they carry structural and fu=
nctional semantics =20

