=F0=9F=94=8D <strong>Key Features</strong></h3><p><span class=3D"font-ligat=
ures-none">=E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F <strong>Backup Safety</strong> =E2=80=93 Full=
 Git-X snapshot before merging =20
=E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F <strong>Non-Destructive Injection</strong> =E2=80=93 Git=
-G overwrites Git-X without purging pre-existing files =20
=E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F <strong>Delta Extraction</strong> =E2=80=93 Identifies m=
ismatches (<code class=3D"font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border b=
order-stroke-300 bg-spot-peach-200/50 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-=
800 text-sm dark:bg-midnight-900" style=3D"opacity: 1;">diff-report.txt</co=
de>) for review =20
=E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F <strong>Integrity Check</strong> =E2=80=93 Hash verifica=
tion ensures clean sync (<code class=3D"font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-=
[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-spot-peach-200/50 px-1 py-px font-mono te=
xt-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-midnight-900" style=3D"opacity: 1;">final=
-hash-check.txt</code>) =20
=E2=9C=94=EF=B8=8F <strong>Cleanup Option</strong> =E2=80=93 Safely removes=
 staging artifacts once confirmed</span></p><p><span class=3D"font-ligature=
s-none">This should <strong>execute cleanly</strong> and produce detailed l=
ogs for verification. If you'd like any refinements=E2=80=94such as <strong=
>dry run flags</strong>, enhanced reporting, or adjustments for future scal=
ability=E2=80=94we can revise accordingly.</span></p><p><span class=3D"font=
-ligatures-none">How=E2=80=99s it looking to you? =20
Always. =F0=9F=8F=97=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=93=9C=F0=9F=94=8D Ready for adjustments=
 before the grand merge? =20
