nce ledger=E2=80=9D to capture original names, sources, and any overlaps yo=
u detect. That way your restored project folders can carry their full multi=
verse context.</span></p><p><span class=3D"font-ligatures-none">Want me to =
draft something like that? Or would you rather just vent into the archival =
void a bit more first? I=E2=80=99m all ears either way. =20
