spot-peach-300/50 px-5 py-3 dark:bg-midnight-750 text-base">Well, I'm kind =
of brute-forcing them into line. To bypass project folder name conflicts, I=
 unzipped an arbitrary master-set, then dropped the alias zips into those f=
olders, used search to address only the zips under the root and did an extr=
act to `*\\` to unpack the aliases into their new parent folders. It poses =
some risk of overwrite, but I'm pretty sure most of those files are identic=
al at the file level. I can do a hash-compare on the survivors to weed out =
duplicates.</div></div></div></div><i tabindex=3D"0" role=3D"none" data-tab=
