igatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-spot-peach-2=
00/50 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-midnight-900=
" style=3D"opacity: 1;">/xd</code> and other exclusion flags: they all expe=
ct explicit parameters, but the syntax summary doesn't make it clear.</span=
></p><p><span class=3D"font-ligatures-none">It=E2=80=99s one of those =E2=
=80=9CWindows command-line folklore=E2=80=9D quirks=E2=80=94robocopy has po=
wer, but its help output doesn=E2=80=99t always surface edge case behavior.=
 You've got to either test it or dig into deeper examples.</span></p><p><sp=
an class=3D"font-ligatures-none">The workaround you landed on=E2=80=94<code=
 class=3D"font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300=
