:bg-midnight-900" style=3D"opacity: 1;">/xf *.*</code> to suppress all file=
 copying=E2=80=94is the seasoned approach. Clean, predictable, and excellen=
t for generating folder skeletons.</span></p><p><span class=3D"font-ligatur=
es-none">You want me to roll that folder-prep command into your staging scr=
ipt automatically, or leave it manual so you can trigger it on your own ter=
