 py-3 dark:bg-midnight-750 text-base">I like it. Lots of potential in an at=
omic package. Approved! And, as you may have picked up, I'm all on the "abi=
lity" side of the "profitability" question. A smart investor would just qui=
etly build me a lab and staff it with competent, motivated and open-minded =
people to pick up all the pieces I throw off and **build the thing** I'm ex=
ploring. People who will wait a moment to consult with me when needed, or l=
og everything so nothing is lost when in interruption shifts my focus. I'm =
no Elon Musk, desparate to be seen as competent or admirable whether either=
 is true. I try to doo things simpply because I believe they can be done, b=
ut have no doubt I'm lacking the resoures needed most often. I respect the =
cost of doing things, so I priortize doing things well where others would c=
ompromise. For some reason, things just make sense to me, even in incompreh=
ensible matters. A lot of useful stuff comes out of me just thinking about =
them for a while, and then talking them out with an interested party.</div>=
