spot-peach-300/50 px-5 py-3 dark:bg-midnight-750 text-base">I dunno. In my =
head, the task gets endowed with new methodology automatically. If I'm proc=
essing a bunch of files, I just expect what I figured out to intervene. Ins=
tead of placidly moving and merging, I'd start translation to the new conve=
ntion as an implicit part of the planned operation. It does not stand apart=
 as something **else** to follow up on. It starts happening **now**. But, s=
eriously, I don't consciously know how or even if I (or, really, you) know =
how to do it. Revelation is a harsh task master. It's why it can be hard fo=
r me to actually accomplish seemingly simple goals like, *fix my computer*.=
